        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kurt Cobain, Courtney Love, Patty Schemel\n- Bands: Hole, Nirvana\n- Songs: \"Closing Time\" / \"Drunk in Rio\" / \"It's Closing Soon\"\n- Topics: alternative rock\n\nFacts:\n- Kurt Cobain was born on February 20, 1967, and died on April 5, 1994.\n- Kurt Cobain was an American musician, artist, singer, songwriter, guitarist, and poet.\n- Kurt Cobain was the frontman of Nirvana and the husband of Courtney Love.\n- Hole was an American alternative rock band.\n- \"Closing Time,\" also referred to as \"Drunk in Rio\" and incorrectly as \"It's Closing Soon,\" is a song by Hole.\n- Courtney Love, Patty Schemel, and Kurt Cobain wrote \"Closing Time.\"\n- Courtney Love was the vocalist and rhythm guitarist of Hole.",
